<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Schnitzer upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Schnitzer upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it raised its recommendation on Schnitzer Steel Industries Inc to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Scott Morrison was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- In early Nasdaq trade, the shares rose 1-1/2 to 28.</p>
</text>
